<title>LITHUANIA: COMMISSION REGISTERS SNORAS CAPITAL BOOST.</title>
<headline>COMMISSION REGISTERS SNORAS CAPITAL BOOST.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lithuania's securities commission said on Tuesday that it registered Snoras Bank's seven million litas share capital increase from additional contributions.</p>
<p>The commission said that the current registered share capital of Snoras bank is 27 million litas.</p>
<p>-- Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
</text>
